  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase II: Pathways to Economic Inclusion and Self-Reliance of the Refugees and Host Communities in Rwanda through Scaling up Grad- Approach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the Graduation Project is to enable targeted poor and vulnerable households of refugees and host communities in Rwanda to become self-reliant and graduate out of dependency on humanitarian assistance by June 2028.</narrative>
